---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Campaigns"
  description="Active, in-development, and scoping campaigns HalfCut funds on Country."
  current="campaigns"
  
>
<section class="proj-hero" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Hero">
  <div class="proj-hero-inner">
    <div>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 24px;">Work happening<br>right now.</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="lede">
      Four active programs, each assessed against a shared governance framework. None of this work is ours to claim. We resource, amplify, and report back.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="filter-bar" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Filters">
  <span class="label">Filter</span>
  <button aria-pressed="true">All</button>
  <button>Active</button>
  <button>In development</button>
  <button>Scoping</button>
  <span style="width: 1px; height: 18px; background: var(--ink-15);"></span>
  <button>Queensland</button>
  <button>NSW</button>
  <button>On-Country programs</button>
  <span class="count">04 projects</span>
</div>

<!-- PROJECT 01 -->
<article class="project-entry" id="jabalbina" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Daintree">
  <div class="pe-media">
    <img src="/photos/photo_106.webp" alt="Daintree rainforest canopy" data-parallax="0.05" loading="lazy">
    <div class="tag-overlay">
      <span class="tag">Active · 2022–</span>
      <span class="tag">Jabalbina · QLD</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number-overlay">01</div>
  </div>
  <div class="pe-text">
    <h2>The Daintree<br>Restoration.</h2>
    <p class="summary">
      Regenerating 1,200 hectares of the oldest continuous rainforest on Earth, alongside the Eastern Kuku Yalanji rangers program. This is our longest-running program and the backbone of everything else we do.
    </p>
    <div class="pe-facts">
      <div>
        <div class="label">Area</div>
        <div class="value">1,200 ha</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="label">Governance</div>
        <div class="value">Jabalbina</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="label">Stage</div>
        <div class="value">Year 4 / 12</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pe-actions">
      <a href="campaign.html?c=daintree" class="btn btn-primary">View campaign →</a>
      <a href="/impact" class="btn btn-secondary">Impact data</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<!-- PROJECT 02 -->
<article class="project-entry reverse" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Yalada">
  <div class="pe-text dark">
    <h2>The Yalada<br>Tour.</h2>
    <p class="summary" style="opacity: .85;">
      Once a year we bring values-aligned organisations onto Jabalbina Country for three days of immersive cultural exchange, shared governance, and deep briefing on the restoration work they're helping resource.
    </p>
    <div class="pe-facts" style="border-color: var(--cream-15);">
      <div style="border-color: var(--cream-15);"><div class="label" style="opacity: .6;">Cohort</div><div class="value">12 partners</div></div>
      <div style="border-color: var(--cream-15);"><div class="label" style="opacity: .6;">Duration</div><div class="value">3 days</div></div>
      <div><div class="label" style="opacity: .6;">Next</div><div class="value">July 2026</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pe-actions">
      <a href="campaign.html?c=yalada" class="btn btn-acid">View campaign →</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="color: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--cream-50);">Get briefed</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pe-media">
    <img src="/photos/photo_004.webp" alt="Yalada Tour on Country" data-parallax="0.05" loading="lazy">
    <div class="tag-overlay">
      <span class="tag">Annual · 2023–</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number-overlay">02</div>
  </div>
</article>

<!-- PROJECT 03 -->
<article class="project-entry" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Capacity">
  <div class="pe-media">
    <img src="/photos/photo_001.webp" alt="Forest understory" data-parallax="0.05" loading="lazy">
    <div class="tag-overlay">
      <span class="tag">In development</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number-overlay">03</div>
  </div>
  <div class="pe-text">
    <h2>Capacity<br>Codified.</h2>
    <p class="summary">
      Documenting the Jabalbina model, the governance, the funding flow, the accountability structures, as a replicable framework other Traditional Owner corporations can adopt and adapt. The aim: ten Jabalbina-equivalent partnerships by 2035.
    </p>
    <div class="pe-facts">
      <div><div class="label">Format</div><div class="value">Open doc</div></div>
      <div><div class="label">Release</div><div class="value">Q3 2026</div></div>
      <div><div class="label">License</div><div class="value">CC BY-SA</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pe-actions">
      <a href="campaign.html?c=capacity" class="btn btn-primary">View campaign →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<!-- PROJECT 04 -->
<article class="project-entry reverse" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Southern">
  <div class="pe-text">
    <h2>Southern<br>Rainforests.</h2>
    <p class="summary">
      We're scoping a second Traditional Owner partnership in the Gondwana remnants of northern NSW. The work is deliberately slow: the right relationship, on Country, at the right pace, is worth more than a fast launch.
    </p>
    <div class="pe-facts">
      <div><div class="label">Region</div><div class="value">Gondwana</div></div>
      <div><div class="label">Status</div><div class="value">Scoping</div></div>
      <div><div class="label">Decision</div><div class="value">Late 2026</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="pe-actions">
      <a href="campaign.html?c=southern" class="btn btn-primary">View campaign →</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Introduce yourself</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pe-media">
    <img src="/photos/photo_068.webp" alt="Seedling scoping work" data-parallax="0.05" loading="lazy">
    <div class="tag-overlay">
      <span class="tag">Scoping · 2026</span>
    </div>
    <div class="number-overlay">04</div>
  </div>
</article>

<!-- HOW THE MONEY MOVES -->
<section class="case-study" data-screen-label="03 Projects · Flow">
  <div class="case-study-head">
    <h2>From donation<br>to Country.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="case-study-grid">
    <div class="cs-step">
      <h4>Donation received</h4>
      <p>Every dollar hits a ring-fenced account. Operational overhead is capped at 8%, independently audited each year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-step">
      <h4>Governance cycle</h4>
      <p>Quarterly, the Traditional Owner partner board reviews the pipeline. They decide what gets funded, in what order, at what scale.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cs-step">
      <h4>Work on Country</h4>
      <p>Funds flow directly to the partner corporation. Rangers do the work. We report back, in their words, on their timeline.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cs-cta">
    <div class="cs-cta-inner">
      <div class="cs-cta-text">
        <h3>Don't just read about it.<br>Fund a hectare.</h3>
        <p class="lede">Every donation is ring-fenced, audited, and travels in a straight line to the Traditional Owners doing the work. No middle layer. No vague promises.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-cta-act">
        <a href="/donate" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl">Donate now →</a>
        <div class="cs-cta-meta">100% of profits to Country, audited quarterly</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
.proj-hero {
    padding: var(--hero-pad-top) var(--pad-x) var(--pad-section-sm);
    background: var(--cream);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
  }
  .proj-hero-inner { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-8); align-items: end; }
  .proj-hero h1 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(64px, 9vw, 180px); line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -0.025em; text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 12ch; }
  .proj-hero .lede { max-width: 40ch; opacity: .75; }

  /* Filter bar — sticky BELOW the fixed nav (nav is ~76px tall so top:76px
     keeps the filter tucked underneath instead of scrolling over the pills). */
  .filter-bar {
    position: sticky; top: 76px; z-index: 40;
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 16px var(--pad-x);
    display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(19,20,14,.05);
  }
  .filter-bar .label { opacity: .5; }
  .filter-bar button {
    padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    transition: background .2s, color .2s, border-color .2s;
  }
  .filter-bar button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .filter-bar .count { margin-left: auto; opacity: .5; letter-spacing: .1em; font-size: 11px; }

  /* Project entries */
  .project-entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 90vh;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
  }
  .project-entry.reverse .pe-text { order: 2; }
  .pe-media {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 640px;
  }
  .pe-media img { position: absolute; top: -6%; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 112%; object-fit: cover; will-change: transform; }
  .pe-media .tag-overlay {
    position: absolute; top: 28px; left: 28px;
    display: flex; gap: 8px;
  }
  .pe-media .tag-overlay .tag { color: var(--cream); border-color: var(--cream-50); background: rgba(19,20,14,.3); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .pe-media .number-overlay {
    position: absolute; bottom: 28px; right: 28px;
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 120px; line-height: .85;
    color: var(--cream); opacity: .85;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .pe-text {
    padding: 96px 64px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  }
  .pe-text > * { max-width: 560px; }
  .pe-text .eyebrow { opacity: .5; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .pe-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 88px);
    line-height: .92;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .pe-text .summary {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .pe-facts {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
  }
  .pe-facts > div {
    padding: 20px 16px 20px 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
  }
  .pe-facts > div:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .pe-facts .label {
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .5;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .pe-facts .value {
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pe-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* Wide section: case study */
  .case-study {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: var(--s-11) var(--pad-x);
  }
  .case-study-head { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto var(--s-8); }
  .case-study-head .eyebrow { color: var(--acid); margin-bottom: 24px; display: block; }
  .case-study-head h2 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 120px); line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; max-width: 16ch; }
  .case-study-grid {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background: var(--cream-15);
  }
  .cs-step { background: var(--ink); padding: var(--s-7) var(--s-6); }
  .cs-step .num { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 72px; line-height: .85; color: var(--acid); margin-bottom: var(--s-4); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cs-step h4 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .cs-step p { font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5; opacity: .75; }

  .cs-cta {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: var(--s-9) auto 0;
    padding: var(--s-8);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--acid) 0%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--acid), #f5ff3d 30%) 100%);
    color: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 2px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cs-cta::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/assets-legacy/topo-pattern-hq.png');
    background-size: 800px;
    opacity: .08;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cs-cta-inner {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-8);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .cs-cta-text .eyebrow { opacity: .6; margin-bottom: var(--s-5); color: var(--ink); }
  .cs-cta-text h3 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 84px);
    line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  .cs-cta-text .lede { max-width: 40ch; color: var(--ink); opacity: .8; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.4vw, 22px); }
  .cs-cta-act { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s-4); }
  .cs-cta-meta { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .6; max-width: 32ch; }

  .pe-text.dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); }
  .pe-text.dark .eyebrow { color: var(--acid); opacity: 1; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .proj-hero { padding: var(--hero-pad-top) var(--pad-x) var(--pad-x); }
    .proj-hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-entry { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-entry.reverse .pe-text { order: 0; }
    .pe-text { padding: var(--pad-x) 24px; }
    .pe-media { min-height: 360px; }
    .case-study-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cs-cta { padding: var(--s-7) var(--s-6); }
    .cs-cta-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-6); }
    .filter-bar { padding: 12px 16px; overflow-x: auto; }
  }
</style>
